But he's so delighted by her.

1889
01:13:37.640 --> 01:13:40.960
He went and learned a little phrase so he could say goodbye to her.

1890
01:13:41.680 --> 01:13:43.340
And then Andy says, you know what?

1891
01:13:43.340 --> 01:13:44.300
I like that guy.

1892
01:13:44.460 --> 01:13:45.720
We should set him up with Meredith.

1893
01:13:46.500 --> 01:13:49.320
I am crushing on Pete in this episode.

1894
01:13:49.320 --> 01:13:53.860
I totally see why he was named one of our pop culture treasures of the week.

1895
01:13:53.940 --> 01:13:54.480
Yeah.

1896
01:13:54.660 --> 01:13:55.640
He's a sweetie pie.

1897
01:13:55.860 --> 01:13:57.340
And you can't help but root for him.

1898
01:13:57.440 --> 01:13:57.860
I know.

1899
01:13:58.140 --> 01:14:00.620
And he's being sweet to Aaron and I like it.

1900
