She's had two real weirdo boyfriends.

1901
01:14:03.660 --> 01:14:04.120
Yeah.

1902
01:14:04.680 --> 01:14:06.360
So I'm liking this.

1903
01:14:07.080 --> 01:14:09.500
Well, that was Andy's ancestry.

1904
01:14:09.860 --> 01:14:10.460
It was.

